{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2023-01-23 11:50:00', 'title': 'COMCAST BRINGS FIBER-RICH NETWORK TO MORE THAN 2,600 HOMES AND BUSINESSES IN PLAINFIELD', 'text': 'HUNDREDS OF HOMES AND BUSINESS IN PLAINFIELD ALREADY SERVICEABLE WITH\xa0 FULL PROJECT TO BE COMPLETED BY END OF YEAR PLAINFIELD, CONN. , JAN. 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ADDING TO ITS INVESTMENT IN CONNECTICUT, COMCAST TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS FURTHER EXPANDING ITS SMART, FAST AND RELIABLE FIBER-RICH NETWORK TO MORE THAN 2,600 RESIDENTS AND BUSINESSES IN THE TOWN OF PLAINFIELD.'}